          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Standard Brita or fridge filters are designed to take things out (like chlorine and sediment). While necessary, this often leaves water 'dead', acidic, stagnant, and difficult to absorb. PeakSpring goes a step further by putting life back in. We restore the electrical charge and liquid crystalline structure of the water, mimicking the properties of a mountain spring. This creates water that doesn't just sit in your stomach but is actively absorbed by your cells for deep hydration."
