        "name": "Is it backed by science?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "While the wellness industry is often filled with hype, we focus on biology. The core benefit of PeakSpring, Molecular Hydrogen (H2), is scientifically recognized as a 'selective antioxidant.' Research shows it targets cytotoxic free radicals (like hydroxyl) while leaving beneficial signaling molecules untouched. Furthermore, our ionization process is ISO 13485 certified, meeting the rigorous standards required for medical device manufacturing."
        }
      },
