        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is installation complicated?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "The system connects seamlessly to your existing faucet in minutes, requiring no invasive plumbing or permanent modifications. We provide a streamlined video guide and real-time support to ensure your setup is smooth. For those who prefer a hidden aesthetic, under-counter conversion kits are also available to keep your sanctuary clutter-free."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Why is it a premium investment?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Unlike standard filters that require frequent replacement and offer limited benefits, PeakSpring is built to last 15–25 years with proper care. It combines three technologies in one, hospital-grade filtration, molecular hydrogen infusion, and ionization. When calculated over its lifespan, the cost per liter is a fraction of bottled water, without the environmental waste. It is an investment in the infrastructure of your health."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What support do I get?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "From the moment you order, you gain access to our concierge support team. You also receive lifetime access to our wellness protocols and a dedicated support line for any technical or usage questions. We ensure your hydration foundation remains solid for years to come."
        }
      }
    ]
